#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Learn about the mathematics of quantum information, including density matrices, channels, measurements, and more."
msgstr "Lerne die Mathematik der Quanteninformation kennen, einschließlich Dichtematrizen, Kanäle, Messungen und mehr."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
